nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布结构化决策模型Microsoft-Decision-1，在36项基准测试中夺冠</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI公开175页四维挂谷猜想证明手稿，挑战数学百年难题</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cloudflare 发布开源多模态决策模型 Clef-omni，支持音视频原生输入</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里 Qoder 正式上线 Fast 模式，实现 3 秒响应及 27% 成本降低</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/200944a70eb0e53b3faf12634ad19144.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里 Qoder 近日正式上线全新的 Fast 模式，支持桌面端 0.4.4 及以上版本，覆盖个人版、企业版、CN 版及国际版。该模式核心优势在于“提速降本”，首次响应时间从原 Performance 模式的 8 秒大幅缩短至 3 秒，相比 Auto 模式及 Ultimate 模式效率显著提升。在成本控制方面，Credits 消耗从 1.1x 降至 0.8x，降幅约 27%。CN 版新增 Fast 档位，国际版则将原 Performance 模式自动升级为 Fast 模式。官方基于 10 个常见开发者任务的横向测评显示，Qoder Fast 模式的完成用时仅为国内同类产品的 1/3、海外同类产品的 1/4。此次升级旨在为日常高频任务提供更高效、经济的交付方案，后续 Qoder 产品家族将陆续接入该模式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云开源内部团队AI协作工具TeamAI，支持跨Agent共享Skill</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/281f72c29056c91d234065fc97b1b348.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云正式开源内部自用的团队AI协作工具TeamAI，该工具基于Git构建，旨在将团队的Skill、工作规范及项目知识纳入Git仓库管理，实现版本控制与评审，达成“一人配置，全员复用”。TeamAI目前已适配WorkBuddy、CodeBuddy、Claude Code、Cursor等16种主流Agent。通过Git协作流程，团队成员提交的技能或规范经合并请求评审后，支持会话启动Hook的Agent可自动拉取最新更新。此外，管理员可通过该工具统一配置符合企业安全要求的模型服务，降低接入风险。TeamAI已集成至腾讯云智能体管理平台ClawPro，支持管理员在管控台中统一管理Skill与MCP配置，并高效分发至已接入的各个Agent中。该工具还具备经验沉淀功能，可在会话结束后将纠正记录与工具失败情况整理成文存入仓</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布结构化决策模型Microsoft-Decision-1，在36项基准测试中夺冠</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4884ec035ee1189b4c1c1af2ae0d74e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软正式推出专注于结构化决策任务的新一代AI模型Microsoft-Decision-1。该模型基于Qwen3.5-9B底座进行专项后训练，在覆盖约15万道问题的36项权威基准测试中准确率均位列第一。其核心功能在于从预设选项中精准选取最优解并提供概率评分，适用于路由分发、内容分类等业务场景，可无缝嵌入现有AI Agent及工作流系统。在性能与成本方面，该模型具备极高运行速度与鲁棒性，决策翻转率极低。定价策略极具竞争力，输入端每百万tokens仅需0.042美元，输出端完全免费。目前，该模型已通过微软AI开发平台向开发者开放，后续计划接入OpenRouter平台，旨在以低成本、高效率的决策能力优化复杂工作流运转。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI公开175页四维挂谷猜想证明手稿，挑战数学百年难题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日公开722篇前沿数学手稿，其中两篇核心论文针对数学界世纪难题“挂谷猜想”取得突破。该研究包含三维挂谷极大函数猜想证明，以及长达175页的四维一般挂谷集合满维证明。在四维版本中，AI将此前维数下界从3.059推进至满维4，论证过程大量借鉴了数学家王虹及其合作者的经典方法。目前，这两篇手稿正处于等待独立专家检验的阶段。若论证被证实成立，将成为挂谷猜想研究的历史性突破，并标志着AI已具备参与甚至主导人类顶尖数学难题攻坚的实力。此次进展不仅刷新了多维数学的认知边界，也引发了学术界对AI在基础科学研究中角色定位的广泛讨论。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cloudflare 发布开源多模态决策模型 Clef-omni，支持音视频原生输入</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5b0c902b021224608de2c2869cb62ca8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cloudflare 正式发布并开源开放权重决策模型 Clef-omni，该模型基于 Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Instruct 底座，首次实现对音频（wav、mp3）及视频（mp4、webm）的原生输入支持。Clef-omni 摒弃了传统将视频拆解为静态图像的处理链路，开发者可通过单次 API 调用实现多模态数据统一处理。性能方面，该模型专注于结构化决策任务，纯文本请求中位响应时间约130毫秒，图像请求约150毫秒，处理21秒音视频仅需约1.5秒。目前模型权重已在 Hugging Face 开源。此外，Cloudflare 同步调整产品定价，Clef-flash 输入价格下调约58%，降至每百万 Token 0.038美元，托管版上下文窗口调整为24k。此次更新旨在为开发者构建复杂智能工作流和自动</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
